%% UC-13 — Submit weekly SRHI check-in
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (srhiService)
    participant M as MongoDB

    F->>B: GET /api/v1/srhi/due
    B->>M: Compute next due window per active intention (weekNumber since creation)
    M-->>B: due windows
    B-->>F: [{intentionId, weekNumber, scheduledFor}]
    P->>F: Answer 12 SRHI items (1-7 scale)
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/srhi {intentionId, weekNumber, items}
    B->>B: Compute score = mean(srhi_1..srhi_12)
    B->>M: upsert(srhi_responses, key {intentionId, weekNumber})
    M-->>B: stored
    B-->>F: 201 {score}
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/srhi/history
    B-->>F: score trajectory per intention
